rows=json.loads((base/'summary.json').read_text());lines=['# Student build verification — 2026-11-08','','Submission reviewed: `junjie` at `c24ed5324b247e98a680b6e58c88adc7a85fd649`. The `hufang` branch at `42cbd7235c2f6c2133eebed394c989cefacba34c` contains catalog/selection files, with no new Docker build results.','','Each accepted capture was obtained by opening the production image in host Chrome. Screenshots and page text establish only the observed landing interface. Authentication, passkeys, downloads, training, remote services, and full application workflows were not exercised. The gallery remains excluded and its image panels were empty in the observation.','','The collector uses the existing reciprocal body mapping rules and independent hash/span verification. It selects at most ten declared production dependencies in alphabetical order. A zero-pair record is retained for manifests without production dependencies or without qualifying mappings for the selected libraries. This does not establish absence of bundled library functions. JavaScript and source maps are the captured bytes, named by SHA-256. Student maps are preserved under `submitted-ground-truth/`; they are not treated as matched browser captures.','','The combined discovery index is [`combined-artifact-index.json`](../../bundling-dataset/combined-artifact-index.json). It retains all 26 previously published repositories, using their saved v2 records where available. The original and active experiment indexes retain their existing cohorts; the combined index is not an experimental score.','','| Subject | Independent build | Browser evidence | Pairs |','|---|---|---|---:|']
